<p align="center"><span style="font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium;">40%</span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="113">
<p><span style="font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium;">R$ 648,40</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="196">
<p><span style="font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium;">06 &ndash; 10 Empregados</span></p>
